 \subsection{Interpretation and Limitations} The retained learned predictors do not establish an improvement over the constant under this task and protocol. That conclusion is narrower than ``the sensors have no damage information.'' The target may not align with the physical signal, a model can be underfit or overfit, and cross-experiment acquisition differences may dominate the small training population. Twenty nominal runs also do not eliminate dependence caused by repeated or equal derived sequences.
